---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const title = "1Only Host - Reliable Web Hosting & Domain Services Provider";
const description = "1Only Host offers premium web hosting and domain services, providing fast, secure, and affordable solutions for businesses and individuals. Get started today!";
const keywords = "web hosting, domain services, reliable hosting, affordable hosting, secure hosting, domain registration, website hosting, cloud hosting, 1Only Host hosting, best web hosting, fast hosting services";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <div class="hero-banner-eight bg-twelve z-1 position-relative pt-130 pb-160 xl-pb-140 md-p0 mesh-bg-1" data-aos="fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-10 text-center">
          <h1 class="hero-heading ">Find Best <span> Unique </span> Domains Use Domain Checker! .</h1>
          <p class="fs-28  font-manrope pt-25 pb-25 pe-xxl-5">Web hosting made easy & affordable, choose a fine-tuned web hosting services solution for successful personal and business websites.</p>
          <div>
            <form action="#" class="m-auto d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between flex-wrap mb-15">
              <input type="name" placeholder="Domain Name..">
              <button>Search Domain</button>
            </form>
            <ul class="style-none d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center">
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="15" viewBox="0 0 18 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M1 8.28571L7 13L16.8571 1" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                </svg>
                No Card required</li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="15" viewBox="0 0 18 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M1 8.28571L7 13L16.8571 1" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                </svg>
                14 Days Free Trial</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section-gap">
    <div class="container">
     
      <div class="row  g-4 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-md-7 col-12">
          <div>
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <h2>Discover the Future with New Domains</h2>
              <p>Unlock endless possibilities with our latest domain extensions. Whether you're launching a startup, blog, or brand, these new domains help you stand out online. Secure a unique identity today and stay ahead in the ever-evolving digital world.</p>
              <p>Unlock endless possibilities with the latest domain extensions. Whether you're launching a brand, blog, or business, a unique domain sets you apart.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-5 col-12">
              <img src="/images/intro1.jpg" alt="" class="ms-auto img-radius">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="block-feature-twentyFive">
    <div class="container lg">
      <div class=" border-2 pt-90 lg-pt-40 pb-90 lg-pb-40">
        <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xl-11 m-auto">
          <div class="title-four text-center mb-80 lg-mb-40 pe-xl-3 ps-xl-3">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Tell me more</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
        <div class="row gx-xxl-5">
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="card-style-twelve text-center mt-20"> <img src="/images/support.svg" alt="" class="m-auto">
              <h4>Why are new domain extensions being introduced</h4>
              <p class="pe-xxl-4 ps-xxl-4">Today, it's hard for businesses and individuals to find domains that are both relevant and available. With over a hundred new domain extensions like .guru, .photography and .clothing being introduced, it will be much easier to find the right domain for your website.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="card-style-twelve text-center mt-20"> <img src="/images/free-domain.svg" alt="" class="m-auto">
              <h4>How does the pre-registration process work?</h4>
              <p class="pe-xxl-4 ps-xxl-4">Pre-registration lets you place an order for a domain before its made available to the general public. Once placed, the moment the domain becomes available, we attempt to purchase it on your behalf. In case the domain is not available, your money is refunded.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="card-style-twelve text-center mt-20"> <img src="/images/free-ssl.svg" alt="" class="m-auto">
              <h4>When will the new domain extensions become available ?</h4>
              <p class="pe-xxl-4 ps-xxl-4">The new extensions will become available for purchase over the course of the next 12-14 months. Use our pre-registration service to ensure that you get your domain as soon as it becomes available.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feedback-section-nine position-relative z-1 pt-80 xl-pt-100 lg-pt-70 pb-130 lg-pb-80 ">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-70 lg-mb-30">
        <h2><span class="counter">12,0000</span>+</h2>
        <p class="fs-28  opacity-75">Customer love our product with more 20+ years reparation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="feedback-slider-six">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s reliable hosting and stellar support have been crucial for our startup’s growth.”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Sarah J.</span> Business Co-Founder</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s has boosted our site’s performance and reliability. Their support is excellent!”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Mike R.</span> Business Owner</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s offers great value and dependable service for my blog. Managing it has never been easier.”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Emily T.</span> Blogger</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s has ensured our online presence runs smoothly with their dedicated service. We’re grateful!”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">John K.</span> Business Director</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="slider-arrows slick-arrow-one d-flex justify-content-center style-none mt-50">
        <li class="prev_b slick-arrow"><i class="icon icon-arrow-left"></i></li>
        <li class="next_b slick-arrow"><i class="icon icon-arrow-right"></i></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
